<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <title>Dashboard</title>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/dashboard.css">
    
</head>

<body>
    <div class="header">
        <div class="profile-pic" title="add a profile picture">

            <% if (imagePath) { %>
                <img src="data:image/jpeg;base64,<%= imagePath %>" id="profile-image" alt="User Image"
                    style="cursor: pointer; width: 75px; height: 90px;">
                <% } else { %>
                    <img src="/img/default-pic.png" id="profile-image" alt="Upload Image"
                        style="cursor: pointer; width: 200px; height: 200px;">
                    <% } %>
                        <input type="file" id="image-upload" style="display: none;">
        </div>

        <form id="uploadForm" action="/dashboard" method="post" encType="multipart/form-data" style="display: none;" >
            <input type="file" name="image" id="hidden-upload">
        </form>

        <h1>Welcome, <%= user.name %>!</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="topnav">
        <a href="/report">Report</a>
        <a href="/logs">Logs</a>
        <a href="/profile">Account</a>
        <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
    </div>

    <div class="row">
        <div class="column">
            <h2>How to report emergency</h2>
            <p>If you have an emergency that you want</p>
            <p>to report, (earthquake, flood, fire, tsunami, etc), you can </p>
            <p>do it by selecting the report button in </p>
            <p>your menu. You will then be prompted to fill</p>
            <p>out a form with your information and the emergency.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="column">
            <h2>Where to find your reports</h2>
            <p>You can find all your reports that you have</p>
            <p>done by selecting the logs button in your menu.</p>
            <p</p>
        </div>

        <div class="column">
            <h2>Update your profile</h2>
            <p>If you want to update your personal</p>
            <p>information, you can do it by selecting the</p>
            <p>account button in your menu.</p>
            <p></p>
            <p></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
        <p class="footer-txt">Developed by Babak Milani for employment purposes. All rights reserved 2024.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Add JavaScript to show the popup -->
    <% if (successMessage.length> 0) { %>
        <script>
            alert("<%= successMessage[0] %>");
        </script>
        <% } %>

            <script src="/javascript/dashboard.js"></script>
</body>

</html>